{
  "name": "Channel Divinity: Spell Ward",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an Action, you can choose another creatue you can see within 30 feet and surround it with a protective barrier that wards against spells. For 1 hour, the target gains Resistance against the damage of spells. At level 6, it also benefits from your Aura of Protection even when outside its radius or when you're Incapacitated.</p>",
